+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+This project's current recorded decision permits plain HTTP (unencrypted, non-TLS) traffic for communication with internal hosts, distinguishing internal service-to-service traffic from external/public-facing endpoints, which remain subject to the project's TLS and certificate verification requirements.
